        "duration_sec": 13.401,
        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "slow_pan",
      "overlay_text": "School bus ~12 m (40 ft)",
      "narration": "For comparison, a standard American school bus is around 12 meters (about 40 feet) long. So Livyatan was at least as long as a school bus, and possibly longer than a bus with another car attached to the back."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s03_03",
      "scene": 3,
      "scene_title": "Size",
      "start_sec": 94.699,
      "end_sec": 109.495,
