        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "",
      "narration": "Now here's what matters more than the length. A sperm whale today has a huge head, and Livyatan likely had one too. That head was packed with the tools for finding and processing prey. And the most important tools were in the mouth."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s04_01",
      "scene": 4,
      "scene_title": "Teeth",
      "start_sec": 109.495,
      "end_sec": 116.689,
