      },
      "motion": "slow_push_in",
      "overlay_text": "",
      "narration": "So the next time you hear someone call the sperm whale the scariest animal in the sea, remember Livyatan. It was bigger, stranger, and maybe more dangerous, and it lived in a world we can only reconstruct from bones and teeth."
